            </div>

            <p>
                Camps are led by Sentinels coaching staff who bring energy,
                patience, and expertise to every session. Players of all
                skill levels are welcome â€” from beginners to experienced
                club players looking to sharpen their game.
            </p>

            <div style="
                        margin-top: 20px;
                        padding: 20px;
                        background: var(--gray-100);
                        border-radius: 8px;
                    ">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt" style="color: var(--green)"></i>
                    Location
                </h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0">
                    <strong>Morgan Hill Community Adult School</strong><br />Morgan Hill, California
                </p>
            </div>
